# Bing Webmaster Tools site ownership
#
# Set BING_SITE_AUTH_CODE in frontend/.env.local or Docker env to the <user>
# value from Bing Webmaster Tools → Add site → Verify → XML file or Meta tag.
#
# The app serves https://YOUR_DOMAIN/BingSiteAuth.xml automatically.
# A msvalidate.01 meta tag is also added to all public pages when the code is set.
#
# For IndexNow URL submission (separate from site verification):
#   npm run seo:rotate-indexnow-key -- --key=<bing-indexnow-key>
